{"id":153686,"date":"2026-02-27T11:43:11","date_gmt":"2026-02-27T11:43:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/?post_type=etablissement&#038;p=153686"},"modified":"2026-03-14T09:37:25","modified_gmt":"2026-03-14T09:37:25","slug":"ecole-superieure-de-commerce-et-dadministration-escoa","status":"publish","type":"etablissement","link":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/etablissement\/ecole-superieure-de-commerce-et-dadministration-escoa\/","title":{"rendered":"Ecole Sup\u00e9rieure de Commerce et d&rsquo;Administration (ESCOA)"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>ESCOA est n\u00e9e de la volont\u00e9 du Groupe Fondateur de proposer une \u00e9cole sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e dans le management moderne et les technologies \u00e9mergentes, apr\u00e8s le succ\u00e8s de ses \u00e9tablissements d\u00e9di\u00e9s \u00e0 la Sant\u00e9, aux BTP et \u00e0 l\u2019Industrie.<\/p>\n<p>Forte de plus de 20 ans d\u2019exp\u00e9rience dans l\u2019enseignement et le management, ESCOA s\u2019appuie sur une expertise acad\u00e9mique et professionnelle reconnue \u00e0 l\u2019international pour concevoir des formations align\u00e9es sur les exigences r\u00e9elles du march\u00e9 de l\u2019emploi.<\/p>\n<p>Les programmes d\u2019ESCOA privil\u00e9gient une approche pratique et orient\u00e9e r\u00e9sultats. Dans chaque fili\u00e8re, les apprenants d\u00e9veloppent des comp\u00e9tences concr\u00e8tes : analyser, mod\u00e9liser, r\u00e9soudre des probl\u00e9matiques r\u00e9elles et concevoir des solutions efficaces gr\u00e2ce aux outils technologiques actuels. L\u2019objectif est de former des professionnels capables d\u2019agir, d\u2019innover et de cr\u00e9er de la valeur d\u00e8s leur entr\u00e9e dans le monde du travail.<\/p>\n<p>ESCOA adopte une vision innovante du management fond\u00e9e sur les Richesses Humaines, la collaboration et l\u2019engagement. L\u2019apprentissage place l\u2019apprenant au c\u0153ur du processus, combinant th\u00e9orie, pratique et accompagnement personnalis\u00e9. R\u00e9sultat : des comp\u00e9tences visibles d\u00e8s la premi\u00e8re ann\u00e9e et une formation tourn\u00e9e vers l\u2019avenir.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":10896,"featured_media":153685,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","format":"standard","back-tax":[],"bourse":[],"domaine":[241,309,305,238],"localite":[418],"niveau":[347,285],"type-etablissement":[291],"type-de-cours":[21],"class_list":{"0":"post-153686","1":"etablissement","2":"type-etablissement","3":"status-publish","4":"format-standard","5":"has-post-thumbnail","7":"domaine-communication-marketing","8":"domaine-comptabilite-et-fiscalite","9":"domaine-finance-banque-et-assurances","10":"domaine-ressource-humaine","11":"localite-dakar","12":"niveau-licence","13":"niveau-master","14":"type-etablissement-etablissement-prive","15":"type-de-cours-formation-initiale"},"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/etablissement\/153686","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/etablissement"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/etablissement"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/10896"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=153686"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/etablissement\/153686\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":159666,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/etablissement\/153686\/revisions\/159666"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/153685"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=153686"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"back-tax","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/bac